WEBVTT

00:07.782 --> 00:13.542
Let's laugh and cry.
chanto waraimasho, nakimasho

00:14.142 --> 00:19.732
Subs originally by Froth-Bite
Manually retyped by #Retrofit@IRC.Rizon.Net
Raws by Darkside-Raws
We need to fill up our hearts.
kokoro no nakami wo juujitsu sasenakuccha

00:19.772 --> 00:28.322
Making matching memories with you...
anata to osoroi no omoide tsukuruno ga

00:28.322 --> 00:30.192
...is important.
daiji daiji

00:31.472 --> 00:34.022
Sometimes I become...
sunao ni narenakattari

00:34.352 --> 00:37.852
...almost dishonest and mean
ijiwaru shichaisouna hi aruno

00:39.352 --> 00:40.692
That's because...
sore wa...

00:42.692 --> 00:45.442
I love you and adore you,
daisuki de taisetsu de

00:45.572 --> 00:48.782
and I don't want to be apart from you.
hanaretaku nai sei nano nante

00:50.742 --> 00:51.742
That's the truth.
henne

00:54.292 --> 01:01.002
I just want to cuddle...
hontou wa itsumo nuku nuku shitetai

01:01.332 --> 01:03.342
...with you.
futaride

01:04.342 --> 01:10.052
So let's laugh and cry.
dakara waraimashou, nakimashou

01:10.722 --> 01:16.142
We need to keep our hearts warm.
kokoro no ondo wo atatame awanakucha

01:16.352 --> 01:24.782
The fate that made us meet...
anata to deaeta unmei ho subetega

01:24.782 --> 01:26.482
...is important.
daiji daiji

01:33.542 --> 01:34.412
Ojo-sama,

01:35.752 --> 01:37.252
we are almost there.

01:37.252 --> 01:38.212
Good.

01:40.542 --> 01:41.422
Ojo-sama,

01:42.592 --> 01:44.252
I am terribly sorry.

01:44.252 --> 01:45.422
Enough.

01:45.962 --> 01:47.342
Hurry, Tachibana.

01:47.342 --> 01:47.922
Yes.

01:49.012 --> 01:53.382
Mother and Daughter

01:59.942 --> 02:01.312
That should do.

02:01.312 --> 02:03.312
We're done over here too.

02:03.862 --> 02:06.112
Now we need to gather them all in one pile...

02:06.112 --> 02:07.612
And stick some sweet potatoes in it!

02:07.612 --> 02:11.322
This marks the beginning of the Annual Narutakisou Baked Potato Party!

02:11.662 --> 02:13.872
Where are the potatoes?

02:13.872 --> 02:16.542
Momo-san is getting some right now.

02:16.542 --> 02:19.792
Where are Asami-chan and Sayoko-san?

02:19.792 --> 02:23.252
Sounded like they were busy with their work.

02:23.252 --> 02:25.252
Let's take some to them when it's done.

02:25.252 --> 02:26.382
Right.

02:27.302 --> 02:30.632
Momo-san, have you found any potatoes yet?

02:31.762 --> 02:33.012
Welcome!

02:35.012 --> 02:36.762
Do you need Asami-chan?

02:36.772 --> 02:39.312
I believe she's in her room.

02:39.312 --> 02:42.192
But she might be busy right now.

02:42.942 --> 02:44.152
Excuse me.

02:54.202 --> 02:56.122
Oh, long time no see.

02:56.702 --> 02:57.410
How about it?

02:57.410 --> 02:57.412
Do you want... to join...
How about it?

02:57.412 --> 02:57.451
Do you want... to join...

03:08.592 --> 03:09.422
Good!

03:09.422 --> 03:12.262
Now add water to this...

03:16.392 --> 03:20.852
It's a bit rich but Mom is really working hard today.

03:45.712 --> 03:48.632
I came to pick you up, Sister.

03:51.172 --> 03:52.212
I'm back!

03:52.222 --> 03:53.972
I brought some juice...

03:54.932 --> 03:55.932
Huh?

03:56.302 --> 03:57.592
Mom?

03:58.562 --> 04:00.262
S-Sayoko-san!

04:01.022 --> 04:03.102
What's going on?

04:03.102 --> 04:06.352
Hey, hey, this is not good.

04:06.352 --> 04:09.572
What are you doing with Sayo-chan?

04:10.072 --> 04:11.782
This is almost kidnapping.

04:11.782 --> 04:12.532
Home...
This is almost kidnapping.

04:13.822 --> 04:15.742
I'm taking her home.

04:17.372 --> 04:18.532
What are you talking about?

04:18.532 --> 04:21.072
Sayo-chan's home is here at Narutakisou.

04:21.072 --> 04:21.952
No.

04:23.622 --> 04:25.872
My sister is going to her home.

04:26.212 --> 04:29.542
Your sister? Her home?

04:29.542 --> 04:29.942
What are you...

04:29.942 --> 04:30.882
Mom?
What are you...

04:31.632 --> 04:33.422
Oh, Mahiru-chan?

04:33.422 --> 04:34.882
What's going on?

04:35.472 --> 04:37.892
Um, is something wrong with Mom?

04:39.472 --> 04:40.762
Tachibana.

04:40.812 --> 04:41.392
Yes.

04:44.392 --> 04:45.392
Asami!

04:46.902 --> 04:47.772
Let's go.

04:47.772 --> 04:48.482
Yes.

04:49.112 --> 04:51.152
Wait a minute!

04:52.712 --> 04:53.572
What?

04:54.282 --> 04:56.072
Don't give me "what"!

04:56.072 --> 04:58.492
You are acting like a kidnapper!

04:58.492 --> 04:59.742
I'm not kidnapping her.

04:59.742 --> 05:01.072
She's going home.

05:01.082 --> 05:02.372
It's common sense.

05:03.832 --> 05:05.792
I don't get it!

05:05.792 --> 05:09.172
Explain everything to me!

05:12.372 --> 05:13.002
Here
Water
Station

05:13.002 --> 05:14.342
A map?
Here
Water
Station

05:14.342 --> 05:14.872
Here
Water
Station

05:15.902 --> 05:16.842
Hey,

05:17.132 --> 05:18.842
that's where my home is.

05:18.842 --> 05:20.802
If you want anything, go there.

05:22.262 --> 05:23.142
Bye.

05:24.852 --> 05:25.722
Hey!

05:25.732 --> 05:27.982
I'm not done talking to you yet!

05:27.982 --> 05:30.062
Wait! Hey!

05:41.572 --> 05:42.872
Mom...

05:45.792 --> 05:46.952
Tachibana.

05:47.292 --> 05:48.002
Yes.

05:50.372 --> 05:51.702
Minazuki

06:00.552 --> 06:02.142
Wow.

06:02.142 --> 06:04.302
It's a castle.

06:04.312 --> 06:05.972
It's not a castle, it's a house.

06:07.932 --> 06:09.692
A house? This is?

06:09.692 --> 06:10.982
Just like...

06:11.812 --> 06:13.732
Just like before.

06:14.152 --> 06:15.732
Mom?

06:15.732 --> 06:18.402
Sister, Asami, let's go inside.

06:20.072 --> 06:21.202
This way.

06:21.202 --> 06:22.322
Yes.

06:29.542 --> 06:31.462
Excuse me.

06:32.542 --> 06:33.542
Umm...

06:33.542 --> 06:34.542
What is it?!

06:34.542 --> 06:35.252
Y-yes.

06:35.252 --> 06:38.512
Ojo-sama and the others are back.

06:39.052 --> 06:42.222
I see, she's back.

06:44.232 --> 06:46.512
Wow.

06:47.472 --> 06:47.972
Sister, this way.

06:47.972 --> 06:49.512
A-amazing!
Sister, this way.

06:49.512 --> 06:49.522
A-amazing!

06:49.522 --> 06:49.932
Asami.
A-amazing!

06:49.932 --> 06:50.562
Asami.

06:50.562 --> 06:51.602
Yes.

06:52.352 --> 06:54.352
Please wait here for a moment.

06:54.692 --> 06:56.692
I will go get the Master.

06:56.692 --> 06:57.402
The Master?

06:57.402 --> 06:57.932
There's no need for that.
The Master?

06:57.932 --> 06:59.032
There's no need for that.

07:00.112 --> 07:01.072
Father.

07:02.952 --> 07:03.992
Sayoko,

07:04.742 --> 07:07.872
you foolish daughter!

07:07.872 --> 07:09.622
A disobedient daughter like you is...

07:10.662 --> 07:12.212
Oh my.

07:12.212 --> 07:14.712
Don't be so upset, Ushimitsu-san

07:14.712 --> 07:18.962
Sayoko-san will get scared.

07:21.012 --> 07:22.342
Welcome home,

07:25.392 --> 07:26.602
Sayoko-san.

07:28.182 --> 07:29.262
Mother.

07:30.482 --> 07:34.192
Ushimitsu-san and I have been very concerned about you.

07:34.192 --> 07:35.852
I really wasn't...

07:36.562 --> 07:40.152
I'm glad to see you're doing fine.

07:40.152 --> 07:41.782
Maybe you got thinner?

07:45.782 --> 07:49.372
Now, let me see you better.

07:51.622 --> 07:54.292
Welcome home, Sayoko-san.

07:54.292 --> 07:57.922
I'm glad I got to see you again.

08:01.762 --> 08:03.132
<i>Mom?</i>

08:06.842 --> 08:07.512
Tachibana.

08:07.892 --> 08:08.432
Yes.

08:08.432 --> 08:09.972
Get rooms ready for them.

08:10.392 --> 08:11.812
We will talk after that.

08:52.932 --> 08:53.892
Sister,

08:55.232 --> 08:57.312
the room is ready.

08:57.312 --> 08:59.442
That uniform brings back memories.

09:00.362 --> 09:03.402
You've grown, Mahiru.

09:05.192 --> 09:06.282
Sister...

09:15.162 --> 09:15.952
Tachibana.

09:16.292 --> 09:17.122
Yes.

09:17.122 --> 09:19.622
How did Mahiru figure out Sayoko's location?

09:19.632 --> 09:20.502
Well...

09:20.502 --> 09:21.462
Is it Yu-chan?

09:21.462 --> 09:22.882
No, it's not...

09:22.882 --> 09:23.712
That's fine.

09:24.302 --> 09:27.472
I know Yu-chan was eager to see Sayoko.

09:27.472 --> 09:29.972
And I understand how Mahiru wanted to see her sister too.

09:30.762 --> 09:32.102
I'm terribly sorry.

09:33.012 --> 09:34.102
Tachibana,

09:34.812 --> 09:35.602
give me the report.

09:36.182 --> 09:36.892
Yes.

09:37.942 --> 09:42.692
Kurosaki died in an accident soon after he eloped with Ojo-sama.

09:42.692 --> 09:45.402
Currently, Ojo-sama is not remarried.

09:45.902 --> 09:48.652
Since then, she hopped around several different apartments and jobs,

09:48.652 --> 09:53.242
and currently lives in an apartment called Narutakisou and works at home.

09:53.242 --> 09:54.412
I see.

09:55.042 --> 09:56.952
Kurosaki is dead.

09:57.792 --> 09:58.962
What about that girl?

09:58.962 --> 10:01.462
She is Kurosaki's daughter, named Asami.

10:02.632 --> 10:03.212
However...

10:15.642 --> 10:18.482
Here, Asami-san, this is it.

10:23.152 --> 10:24.442
Wow.

10:24.442 --> 10:27.282
It's like a hotel room I saw in Momono-san's magazine.

10:27.822 --> 10:31.202
Use this room like it is yours.

10:31.822 --> 10:34.202
My room? But...

10:34.202 --> 10:36.372
Don't be so modest.

10:36.372 --> 10:39.462
You're Sayoko-san's daughter.

10:43.422 --> 10:44.042
Yes.

10:44.552 --> 10:46.302
I'm here now, my lady.

10:46.302 --> 10:49.262
Oh, good timing, Sakura-san!

10:52.222 --> 10:53.342
Um...

10:53.352 --> 10:55.562
Don't move, Asami-san.

10:58.182 --> 10:59.312
There!

11:02.652 --> 11:04.982
You look so cute!

11:04.982 --> 11:06.902
R-really?

11:07.322 --> 11:09.612
You really look lovely.

11:09.902 --> 11:14.032
Those are the clothes Sayoko-san wore when she was a child.

11:15.012 --> 11:16.412
Mom did?

11:17.622 --> 11:19.332
I see.

11:20.462 --> 11:21.792
Asami-san, Asami-san,

11:21.792 --> 11:24.212
you can see it better this way.

11:24.502 --> 11:25.672
See?

11:28.302 --> 11:29.302
No...

11:30.972 --> 11:34.182
No sunlight...

11:34.182 --> 11:34.652
I'm sorry, my lady!
No sunlight...

11:34.652 --> 11:36.012
I'm sorry, my lady!

11:36.432 --> 11:37.812
Are you okay?!

11:37.812 --> 11:38.312
Y-y-yes...
Are you okay?!

11:38.312 --> 11:40.352
Y-y-yes...

11:40.352 --> 11:42.192
I'm fine.

11:44.522 --> 11:47.982
Please don't worry.

11:49.442 --> 11:52.242
I'm sorry, my lady!

11:52.242 --> 11:53.742
That was so bright.

11:55.872 --> 11:59.912
So, she's not Kurosaki's actual daughter?

11:59.912 --> 12:00.702
Correct.

12:00.702 --> 12:02.292
Was she his previous wife's daughter?

12:02.292 --> 12:03.002
No.

12:03.502 --> 12:06.132
Kurosaki was raised at an orphanage.

12:06.132 --> 12:10.002
It appears that Kurosaki adopted her from that orphanage.

12:10.012 --> 12:11.462
I see.

12:12.802 --> 12:14.382
Asami is her name, right?

12:15.052 --> 12:18.642
We should keep her away from Sayoko for a while.

12:19.182 --> 12:22.602
Arrange things so they won't meet anytime soon.

12:22.602 --> 12:23.352
Yes.

12:27.902 --> 12:30.732
My lady, we're here.

12:30.732 --> 12:32.362
Oh, yes.

12:32.612 --> 12:35.282
I'm terribly sorry, milady.

12:35.282 --> 12:37.452
It's okay, Sakura-san.

12:37.452 --> 12:40.332
Thank you for bringing me back to my room.

12:40.332 --> 12:42.372
I'm over here.

12:42.832 --> 12:44.712
Sakura-san, how did you get there?

12:44.712 --> 12:47.042
My lady...

12:47.042 --> 12:48.382
Oh, yes.

12:49.422 --> 12:53.552
Asami-san, I'm going to go rest now.

12:53.552 --> 12:57.222
But you can make yourself at home, and relax.

12:58.392 --> 12:59.222
Yes.

12:59.512 --> 13:00.852
Well, then.

13:00.852 --> 13:02.722
Take care.

13:04.312 --> 13:06.942
I'm such a klutz.

13:07.522 --> 13:09.692
Why am I like this all the time?

13:11.322 --> 13:15.402
By the way, I wonder where Mom is?

13:15.402 --> 13:17.452
Oh, well...

13:18.072 --> 13:18.912
Sakura.

13:20.742 --> 13:22.082
Oh, Senpai.

13:22.082 --> 13:23.752
I need to talk to you.

13:24.832 --> 13:26.792
I'll go back to my room.

13:26.792 --> 13:28.502
Can you find your way?

13:28.502 --> 13:28.962
Yes.

13:28.962 --> 13:30.132
Then see you later.

13:30.132 --> 13:30.962
Yes.

13:38.012 --> 13:39.392
What are you doing?

13:39.392 --> 13:40.682
Mahiru-chan.

13:41.222 --> 13:42.142
This portrait...

13:42.972 --> 13:45.062
Oh, it's sister's.

13:45.062 --> 13:46.642
Just as I thought.

13:47.062 --> 13:50.812
So Mom comes from a rich family.

13:50.812 --> 13:54.402
You're Mom's younger sister, right?

13:54.402 --> 13:55.442
I'm sorry.

13:56.612 --> 13:58.612
I'm sorry I kept it quiet.

13:58.612 --> 14:00.242
It's okay.

14:00.742 --> 14:03.412
I was a bit surprised today, but...

14:03.412 --> 14:04.452
Oh yes.

14:04.452 --> 14:07.162
Can I use your phone?

14:07.922 --> 14:08.602
Phone?

14:09.102 --> 14:11.272
Oh, jeez!

14:11.372 --> 14:11.632
Here
Water
Station

14:11.632 --> 14:14.022
The hell with "if you want anything go there!!"
Here
Water
Station

14:14.022 --> 14:14.092
Here
Water
Station

14:14.092 --> 14:14.122
This map is no good!
Here
Water
Station

14:14.122 --> 14:16.012
This map is no good!

14:16.012 --> 14:16.772
Well, well, Momono-san.
This map is no good!

14:16.772 --> 14:18.092
Well, well, Momono-san.

14:18.092 --> 14:20.682
We just need to decipher it.

14:20.682 --> 14:22.222
He's right.

14:22.222 --> 14:24.222
What does this flower signify?

14:24.892 --> 14:29.892
How many train stations are near a creek in Tokyo?

14:29.902 --> 14:30.942
Is it a flower bed?

14:30.942 --> 14:32.232
Or a flower shop?

14:34.152 --> 14:34.542
Yes.

14:34.692 --> 14:35.212
When can we go rescue them...

14:35.212 --> 14:35.472
Yes.
When can we go rescue them...

14:35.472 --> 14:36.442
Hello.
When can we go rescue them...

14:36.442 --> 14:37.812
When can we go rescue them...

14:37.822 --> 14:38.902
Asami-chan?

14:40.202 --> 14:41.242
Is that you?

14:41.622 --> 14:42.912
Yup, it's me.

14:42.912 --> 14:44.452
I'm sorry we caused you to worry.

14:44.992 --> 14:47.332
We're at Mom's home right now.

14:48.502 --> 14:50.082
Yeah, we're fine.

14:50.082 --> 14:51.832
I guess we're staying here for a while.

14:51.832 --> 14:53.792
We'll tell you everything when we get back.

14:54.502 --> 14:54.882
Oh?

14:54.882 --> 14:56.092
Asami-chan!

14:56.462 --> 14:57.802
Are you really okay?!

14:57.802 --> 14:58.802
Momono-san!

14:59.222 --> 15:00.682
M-Momono-san?

15:00.682 --> 15:02.842
Are you being forced to say you're fine...

15:02.842 --> 15:05.432
By those fiendish looking women?!

15:05.812 --> 15:07.642
I'm fine.

15:07.642 --> 15:10.432
It's an amazing place, just like a hotel.

15:11.312 --> 15:14.192
Well, as long as you're okay...

15:14.192 --> 15:15.232
That's how it is.

15:15.232 --> 15:16.402
Don't worry.

15:18.242 --> 15:19.282
Hey, wait!

15:19.282 --> 15:20.702
Don't treat me like that!

15:20.702 --> 15:22.722
Explain everything.

15:22.722 --> 15:22.932
you atrocious kidnappers!

15:22.932 --> 15:24.432
I guess...
you atrocious kidnappers!

15:24.432 --> 15:24.482
you atrocious kidnappers!

15:24.482 --> 15:25.762
They're fine.
you atrocious kidnappers!

15:25.762 --> 15:26.102
They're fine.

15:26.102 --> 15:26.952
Man, they really piss me off!

15:26.952 --> 15:29.102
Momono-san, calm down.
Man, they really piss me off!

15:29.102 --> 15:29.162
Momono-san, calm down.

15:30.622 --> 15:32.672
Senpai, what did you need?

15:32.922 --> 15:36.422
Oh, don't let Asami-san get close to Sayoko Ojo-sama?

15:37.712 --> 15:39.382
You are too loud.

15:39.382 --> 15:41.012
I'm sorry.

15:41.012 --> 15:42.682
Anyway, take note of that.

15:42.682 --> 15:43.552
That's how it is.

15:45.302 --> 15:46.802
Oh, yes.

15:46.812 --> 15:47.602
Yes?

15:48.562 --> 15:50.352
If you fail,

15:52.312 --> 15:53.232
be prepared.

15:54.402 --> 15:55.482
I am counting on you.

15:59.282 --> 16:02.952
I've only seen such big steaks in supermarket ads!

16:02.952 --> 16:05.992
The Minazuki family has a five-star chef.

16:05.992 --> 16:07.332
Don't hold back.

16:07.332 --> 16:08.372
Eat a lot.

16:08.702 --> 16:11.162
Yes, let's ea...

16:12.122 --> 16:13.372
Is something wrong?

16:13.922 --> 16:16.382
Um, where is Mom?

16:16.752 --> 16:18.712
Good question.

16:20.922 --> 16:23.672
Hey, go get Sister.

16:23.682 --> 16:27.392
Sayoko Ojo-sama ate earlier, and headed for bed already.

16:28.852 --> 16:29.852
So that's what happened.

16:29.852 --> 16:31.102
Yes, it is!

16:32.062 --> 16:33.062
I see.

16:33.062 --> 16:34.852
Silly Mom.

16:34.852 --> 16:36.352
She's such a glutton.

16:36.942 --> 16:39.442
It's much better when we all eat together.

16:39.442 --> 16:40.572
Right, Mahiru-chan?

16:41.072 --> 16:42.362
Y-yeah...

16:42.362 --> 16:44.952
Then I'll eat!

16:44.952 --> 16:46.862
Enjoy!

16:47.622 --> 16:48.662
It's no good!

16:48.662 --> 16:50.282
You can have more after this.

16:50.292 --> 16:51.332
Yay!

16:53.002 --> 16:54.872
Thank you for the meal.

16:55.252 --> 16:56.542
Now...

16:56.542 --> 16:57.632
What are you doing?

16:58.382 --> 17:00.842
We must clean up after we eat.

17:00.842 --> 17:02.552
Asami-san, I will take care of them.

17:06.302 --> 17:08.142
I've never taken a bubble bath!

17:08.142 --> 17:09.432
It's like a movie!

17:09.432 --> 17:10.472
Really?

17:13.892 --> 17:15.232
I'm getting out first.

17:15.232 --> 17:16.062
Yup.

17:20.522 --> 17:21.902
Asami-san!

17:21.902 --> 17:23.532
Hang on...

17:23.532 --> 17:24.612
What were you doing?

17:24.612 --> 17:27.572
I couldn't waste the bubbles...

17:27.572 --> 17:29.992
How about something cold to drink to cool off?

17:31.742 --> 17:33.582
You can have anything you want.

17:34.202 --> 17:35.622
Anything?

17:36.252 --> 17:37.162
Then...

17:41.672 --> 17:43.052
What's that?

17:43.052 --> 17:44.592
It's fruit milk!

17:44.592 --> 17:45.342
Weird.

17:45.342 --> 17:46.802
How you drink it is weird too.

17:46.802 --> 17:49.932
That's the way you're supposed to drink it!

